*** Settings ***
Documentation       Technical helper keywords for e-mails. Only here are keywords of the ImapLibrary2 used.
Resource            ${EXECDIR}/resources/abilities/email_ability.resource
Keyword Tags        interaction


*** Keywords ***
Open Mailbox Connection
    [Documentation]    Logs in to the mailbox.
    Open Mailbox    host=${EMAIL_HOST}    user=${EMAIL_USER}    password=${EMAIL_PASSWORD}    port=${EMAIL_PORT}

Close Mailbox Connection
    [Documentation]    Logs out of the mailbox.
    Close Mailbox

Wait For New Email
    [Documentation]    Waits for an e-mail with sender and subject and returns its identifier.
    [Arguments]    ${sender}    ${subject}
    ${email_id}    Wait For Email    sender=${sender}    subject=${subject}    timeout=${EMAIL_WAIT_SECONDS}
    RETURN    ${email_id}

Read Email Text
    [Documentation]    Returns the text of an e-mail.
    [Arguments]    ${email_id}
    ${text}    Get Email Body    ${email_id}
    RETURN    ${text}

Read Links In Email
    [Documentation]    Returns all links of an e-mail as a list.
    [Arguments]    ${email_id}
    ${links}    Get Links From Email    ${email_id}
    RETURN    ${links}
